{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-refresher/1/output.schema.json",
    "title": "知识刷新批次输出合同",
    "summary": "该 JSON Schema 定义 KnowledgeBatch.v1 的批次、文档、章节、引用和问题结构，并通过枚举、长度、数量及 additionalProperties 约束输出；它是验证合同，不是刷新逻辑或通过验证的证据。",
    "category": "implementation",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "batch",
        "title": "批次与文档结构",
        "body": "合同采用 JSON Schema 2020-12，顶层要求版本恒为 1，并要求 `documents` 包含 1 至 16 个文档。[[c1]] 每个文档必须提供键、标题、摘要、类别、章节、引用和问题，且禁止未声明字段；类别限定为概览、架构、需求、进展、实现、测试、配置等受控值。[[c2]] 这使宿主能稳定解析刷新结果，但不说明任何一次模型输出已经通过验证。"
      },
      {
        "key": "content",
        "title": "章节与引用约束",
        "body": "章节数量限制为 1 至 20，章节键必须符合受限标识符格式，并要求标题与正文。[[c3]] 引用则限定数量、键格式、可读标签、理由和关系枚举；目标只能是材料或文章，可附材料行号或文章章节，同时要求 `quote` 字段。[[c4]] 这些规则约束引用形状和定位信息，却不能单独验证引用是否在语义上真正支持正文。"
      },
      {
        "key": "questions",
        "title": "疑问记录与严格性",
        "body": "疑问项要求问题、原因、下一步、阻塞状态和关联引用键，从而把未确定事项保留为可跟踪结构，而不是混入确定结论。[[c5]] 顶层和文档层均列出必填字段并禁用额外属性，合同标识为 `KnowledgeBatch.v1`；因此兼容性依赖生产者严格遵守该版本。[[c6]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "批次版本与文档数量",
        "reason": "支持顶层版本常量及批次文档数量边界。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-refresher/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 14
        },
        "quote": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"schema_version\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"const\": 1\n    },\n    \"documents\": {\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"maxItems\": 16,\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\","
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "文档字段与类别集合",
        "reason": "支持文档元数据、受控类别以及后续内容结构的定义。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-refresher/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 15,
          "endLine": 48
        },
        "quote": "        \"properties\": {\n          \"key\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"maxLength\": 500\n          },\n          \"title\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1,\n            \"maxLength\": 240\n          },\n          \"summary\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n   "
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "章节结构约束",
        "reason": "支持章节数量、键格式和必填内容字段的限制。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-refresher/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 48,
          "endLine": 77
        },
        "quote": "          \"sections\": {\n            \"minItems\": 1,\n            \"maxItems\": 20,\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"key\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"pattern\": \"^[a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9_-]{0,59}$\"\n     "
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "引用结构与目标类型",
        "reason": "支持引用数量、关系枚举、目标定位和 quote 字段要求。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-refresher/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 78,
          "endLine": 164
        },
        "quote": "          \"citations\": {\n            \"minItems\": 1,\n            \"maxItems\": 160,\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"key\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"pattern\": \"^[a-zA-Z][a-zA-Z0-9_-]{0,39}$\"\n   "
      },
      {
        "key": "c5",
        "label": "疑问项合同",
        "reason": "支持疑问必须记录原因、下一步、阻塞状态及关联引用键。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-refresher/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 166,
          "endLine": 206
        },
        "quote": "          \"questions\": {\n            \"maxItems\": 20,\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"question\": {\n                  \"type\": \"string\",\n                  \"minLength\": 1,\n                  \"maxLength\": 1000\n                }"
      },
      {
        "key": "c6",
        "label": "必填字段与合同标识",
        "reason": "支持文档和顶层字段均被严格要求，以及模式的正式标识。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/agent-runtime/roles/knowledge-refresher/1/output.schema.json",
          "startLine": 208,
          "endLine": 227
        },
        "quote": "        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"key\",\n          \"title\",\n          \"summary\",\n          \"category\",\n          \"sections\",\n          \"citations\",\n          \"questions\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"schema_version\",\n    \"documents\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalP"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "宿主是否还执行引用正文出现性、行号有效性和语义支持性等超出 JSON Schema 的检查？",
        "why": "该合同能校验结构、枚举和长度，但没有表达“每个引用必须出现在正文”或“引用必须语义支持论断”等跨字段和语义规则。",
        "nextStep": "检查宿主验证流程，并分别用未使用引用、越界行号和不支持正文的引用做行为测试，记录拒绝阶段与错误信息。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c3",
          "c4",
          "c6"
        ]
      },
      {
        "question": "宿主是否额外检查引用在正文中的出现性、行号有效性及语义支持性？",
        "why": "该 JSON Schema 约束字段形状、枚举、数量和长度，但没有表达这些跨字段或语义规则。",
        "nextStep": "检查宿主验证流程，并用未使用引用、越界行号和不支持论断的引用进行行为测试。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
